## Rendered by ../../render-configs.sh from this .template — edit the
## .template, never the rendered acquis.yaml (it gets overwritten). No
## ${VAR} substitution actually happens in this particular file (nothing
## here is node-specific) — still a .template because every file under a
## config/ dir in this repo is, so the "never hand-edit the rendered
## output" rule stays uniform across the whole stack rather than being an
## exception for this one file.
##
## Tells crowdsec's agent half what to read and how to label it for the
## parser chain — see docker-compose.yml's COLLECTIONS for which
## collections actually consume each label. Two sources, `---`-separated
## (crowdsec's acquis.yaml is a multi-document YAML stream, one acquisition
## config per source):

filenames:
  - /var/log/traefik/access.log
labels:
  type: traefik
---
filenames:
  - /var/log/auth.log
labels:
  type: syslog
